Imagery: USDA NAIP aerial photography via USGS The National Map, which is
public domain, graded by Glamis Guide.

Places, descriptions and closed-area outlines: Copyright Glamis Guide
(Andy Eveland). Free for personal use with any app or device. Please link
to https://glamisguide.app/downloads/ rather than re-hosting the files,
so riders get the current set. The closures follow BLM and Wilderness
Connect data and may lag official changes; obey posted signs.
